                                        "entry_id": "798d85d1-7d8c-3411-a801-acc422bf7153",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A movement for the promotion of behaviors related to anorexia nervosa."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de2ead8f-b179-4da8-a4f9-7b664cd922bb",
                                                "sense_id": "2b2cfe77-a20f-3296-8eb3-76d309125e8c",
                                                "text": "Pro-ana is not a disease, Mr. Crane, it's a lifestyle choice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed7075c5-1722-4c4a-8a68-4629a866fec0",
                                                "sense_id": "2b2cfe77-a20f-3296-8eb3-76d309125e8c",
                                                "text": "Alicia: It's a pro-ana website, isn't it?\nDiane: Objection. Relevance?\nHoward: Yeah, I- I don't get it. What is that?\nAlicia: Pro-ana? It's a site intended to promote anorexia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e8af6e0-bcbe-3300-85b0-6084c88b79d7",
                                        "entry_id": "798d85d1-7d8c-3411-a801-acc422bf7153",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of this movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3cf88c0-93e2-45c7-be83-441bcdadb62a",
                                                "sense_id": "7e8af6e0-bcbe-3300-85b0-6084c88b79d7",
                                                "text": "Beyond celebrating the aesthetic value of thinness, pro-anas claim that thinness is a reflection of excellence in other areas of one's life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb062b02-d5a6-4c2b-9403-1392cd672bbe",
                                                "sense_id": "7e8af6e0-bcbe-3300-85b0-6084c88b79d7",
                                                "text": "But juxtaposed to a caveat about the life-threatening nature of anorexia is often an avowal of the pro-ana's goal: to help anorexics in their quest for the \"ideal\" (emaciated) body."
                                            }
                                        ]
